// The compiler scaling gate's corpus family (Tower #4601), shared by the
// generator (Tools/perf/scaling/generate) and the gate harness twins:
// Packages.jet (seeded draws, consumer trees, manifests), Corpora.jet (the
// stress shapes and `corpus`), Domains.jet (the realistic domain shapes) and
// Mixed.jet (the `mixed` compile-throughput profile). One package shares one
// namespace, so the twins import these names with `use jet_scaling_corpora.[...]`.
name: "jet_scaling_corpora"
version: "0.0.1"
edition: "2026"
